    "group": "Crusade Ancient",
    "summary": "In the Fight phase, the Crusade Ancient can activate this ability. Roll a D6 if a model in the Crusade Ancient’s unit is destroyed and the Crusade Ancient’s unit still awaits its fight activation. A 4+ keeps the destroyed model in play to fight on the same activation as the Crusade Ancient’s unit. If they have yet to fight when the phase closes, fight then. Remove the destroyed model once it has fought.",
